## ⚙️ Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/cms2.git
```

```bash
cd cms2
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
composer install
```

```bash
npm install
```

### Environment

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

Generate Application Key

```bash
php artisan key:generate
```

Configure your database inside `.env`

```env
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=cms2
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=
```

### Run Migrations

```bash
php artisan migrate
```

(Optional)

```bash
php artisan db:seed
```

### Build Frontend

```bash
npm run dev
```

or

```bash
npm run build
```

### Run Application

```bash
php artisan serve
```

Visit

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

---

## 🔐 Default Login

Create your own administrator account or seed the database if a seeder is available.

