## 🔄 Migration from CMS 1.0

CMS 2.0 is a complete rebuild of the original Contract Management System.

| CMS 1.0 | CMS 2.0 |
|----------|----------|
| Vanilla PHP | Laravel |
| jQuery | Livewire + Alpine |
| Manual Routing | Laravel Routing |
| Procedural Structure | MVC Architecture |
| Basic Authentication | Laravel Authentication |
| Difficult Maintenance | Modular & Maintainable |
| Limited Scalability | Enterprise Ready |

